/*
 * Finalization of template declaration rewriting.
 *
 * TemplateDeclareFinalization performs the final rewriting and validation
 * steps required before declaring a template-instantiated symbol. After
 * template solving produces a TemplateMapper, this module:
 *
 *   - merges mapper information with previously stored template mappers,
 *   - rewrites template parameters and declaration nodes,
 *   - resolves lambda prototypes and generates frame generators,
 *   - verifies template guard expressions,
 *   - ensures all template parameters are fully resolved,
 *   - produces the final Declaration and TemplateMapper used for symbol
 *     instantiation.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::declare::finalize
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/declare/finalize.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-14
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
